abstract: >
  Pre-registered independent study of calibration under difficulty for
  TypeSafe System One (Jev). Metrics and charts regenerate offline from
  committed JSONL via `make reproduce`. Pin jev-1.13.0; Arena is replay-only
  for scored numbers.
